WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.875
Welcome to Reviyo partner training.

00:00:02.875 --> 00:00:06.135
This class takes you from your first conversation with a business

00:00:06.135 --> 00:00:10.090
owner to a prepared account, a secure payment, and a useful

00:00:10.090 --> 00:00:11.565
handover.

00:00:11.565 --> 00:00:14.405
Your job is to help the owner understand the service and

00:00:14.405 --> 00:00:17.135
decide whether it fits their business.

00:00:17.135 --> 00:00:20.120
A good sale starts with listening and ends with a confident

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:22.275
owner who knows what they bought.

00:00:22.825 --> 00:00:26.300
Reviyo helps customers describe a real visit and prepare a review

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:27.670
draft.

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:31.690
It does not guarantee five stars, a number of reviews, a

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:34.910
Google ranking, or extra sales.

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:37.910
The customer reads and edits the draft and posts on Google

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:39.520
themselves.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:43.880
Never offer rewards for reviews or ask only happy customers.

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:48.085
Pause this class whenever you want to practise a conversation.

00:00:48.085 --> 00:00:53.360
The examples are practice conversations, not customer testimonials.

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:57.840
Start with local businesses where customers visit and the owner wants

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:00.620
a simpler way to request reviews.

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:05.855
Restaurants, salons, stores, and service businesses can be suitable.

00:01:05.855 --> 00:01:09.795
Each plan covers one business, one location, and one Google Business

00:01:09.795 --> 00:01:11.270
Profile.

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:14.080
Check whether the owner has the correct Google listing and can

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:16.065
reach its review link.

00:01:16.065 --> 00:01:19.700
Do not invent lost revenue from a low review count.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:23.240
You are checking whether there is a real problem to solve.

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:27.645
You can say: Hi, I help local businesses make it easier

00:01:27.645 --> 00:01:30.545
for customers to write a Google review.

00:01:30.545 --> 00:01:33.625
Is now a good time for a two minute demo?

00:01:33.625 --> 00:01:37.705
If they are serving customers, ask when you can return.

00:01:37.705 --> 00:01:41.345
Speak to someone who can decide about the subscription.

00:01:41.345 --> 00:01:44.515
If they say no, thank them and stop.

00:01:44.515 --> 00:01:49.015
For a message, introduce yourself honestly and ask permission before sending

00:01:49.015 --> 00:01:50.875
a demonstration.

00:01:50.875 --> 00:01:54.215
Avoid repeatedly messaging people who have not agreed to a follow

00:01:54.215 --> 00:01:55.270
up.

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:58.670
Ask three simple questions.

00:01:58.670 --> 00:02:01.815
How do you ask customers for reviews now?

00:02:01.815 --> 00:02:06.495
When a customer agrees, what usually stops them from finishing?

00:02:06.495 --> 00:02:09.120
Who would look after the QR code and explain it to

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:10.645
your staff?

00:02:10.645 --> 00:02:12.910
Listen without interrupting.

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:16.090
They may already have a Google QR code, or they may

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:18.185
not want another tool.

00:02:18.185 --> 00:02:21.995
Learn whether the issue is finding the link, thinking of words,

00:02:21.995 --> 00:02:23.860
or finding time.

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:27.845
Reviyo is useful only if its workflow addresses their need.

00:02:28.395 --> 00:02:33.010
For example, say: So customers are willing, but some do not

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:34.760
know what to write.

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:37.035
Let me show you how they can start with their own

00:02:37.035 --> 00:02:39.620
experience and edit a draft.

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:42.590
Use their actual answer rather than this line if their problem

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:44.145
is different.

00:02:44.145 --> 00:02:47.750
Confirm that you understood them before opening the demo.

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:50.895
This keeps the conversation relevant and avoids a long list of

00:02:50.895 --> 00:02:53.020
features they do not need.

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:56.585
Here is your opening explanation.

00:02:56.585 --> 00:02:59.970
Reviyo gives your business a QR review page.

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:05.550
Customers scan it, choose relevant topics, and describe their real visit.

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:08.355
They get a draft they can edit, then choose whether to

00:03:08.355 --> 00:03:10.930
post it on Google themselves.

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:15.220
You can customise the topics and see activity in your dashboard.

00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:18.680
Would you like to see the customer journey on a phone?

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:21.175
Keep this explanation short.

00:03:21.175 --> 00:03:24.060
Let the demo answer the next questions.

00:03:24.610 --> 00:03:27.690
Explain benefits in everyday language.

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:32.055
A printable QR gives staff one simple way to invite feedback.

00:03:32.055 --> 00:03:36.275
Relevant topics help a customer remember what they experienced.

00:03:36.275 --> 00:03:39.460
An editable draft gives them a starting point rather than asking

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:41.935
them to write from a blank page.

00:03:41.935 --> 00:03:46.025
Dashboard activity helps the owner see where people stop.

00:03:46.025 --> 00:03:48.550
An open Google link is not proof that a review was

00:03:48.550 --> 00:03:50.005
published.

00:03:50.005 --> 00:03:53.920
Do not describe those clicks as verified Google reviews.

00:03:54.820 --> 00:03:57.655
Use an authorised demo page and explain that it is a

00:03:57.655 --> 00:03:59.445
demonstration.

00:03:59.445 --> 00:04:03.145
Show the QR being scanned and the review page opening.

00:04:03.145 --> 00:04:07.420
Select topics that relate to a genuine experience, explain the consent

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:10.135
step, and show a draft.

00:04:10.135 --> 00:04:13.585
Read it together and change any inaccurate wording.

00:04:13.585 --> 00:04:17.595
Then explain how the customer opens Google, chooses their own stars

00:04:17.595 --> 00:04:20.585
there, and posts their own review.

00:04:20.585 --> 00:04:24.600
Stop before publishing a practice review to a real business.

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:28.460
Say: Please try editing this draft.

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:31.295
Your customers have the same control.

00:04:31.295 --> 00:04:35.290
They can change it, discard it, or choose not to post.

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:39.370
If the owner asks whether AI writes fake experiences, explain that

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:43.610
customers must describe what really happened and correct the draft.

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:46.315
The tool is an assistant for wording.

00:04:46.315 --> 00:04:49.900
It cannot create a genuine customer experience.

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:54.525
Show a balanced example rather than pretending every visitor is delighted.

00:04:55.425 --> 00:04:59.180
The current plans are five hundred rupees for one month, one

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:03.200
thousand nine hundred and ninety nine rupees for six months, and

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:07.830
two thousand nine hundred and ninety nine rupees for twelve months.

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:11.015
These plans have the same included features.

00:05:11.015 --> 00:05:14.925
The term changes, not the number of locations.

00:05:14.925 --> 00:05:18.195
The longer terms are paid as the full amount shown, not

00:05:18.195 --> 00:05:20.550
as monthly instalments.

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:24.510
Confirm the current price in the owner's checkout before payment, since

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:27.505
prices may change after this recording.

00:05:28.055 --> 00:05:31.885
Ask: Would a shorter commitment suit you, or do you already

00:05:31.885 --> 00:05:34.790
want to use this for a longer period?

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:38.650
I can help you compare the total amount before you decide.

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:42.250
Businesses prepared through the partner dashboard are paid setups and do

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:44.540
not include a free trial.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:47.665
Say that clearly before inviting the owner.

00:05:47.665 --> 00:05:50.930
Do not promise a fourteen day trial or describe the commission

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:53.715
waiting period as an owner's trial.

00:05:53.715 --> 00:05:56.130
Let the owner choose a plan based on their needs and

00:05:56.130 --> 00:05:57.350
budget.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:02.195
If the owner says they already have a Google QR, reply:

00:06:02.195 --> 00:06:04.425
That is a useful start.

00:06:04.425 --> 00:06:08.000
Reviyo adds prompts and an editable draft before the customer opens

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:09.255
Google.

00:06:09.255 --> 00:06:12.910
If your current QR already solves the problem, you may not

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:14.730
need another tool.

00:06:14.730 --> 00:06:19.180
If they say customers can write reviews themselves, agree.

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:23.305
Reviyo is optional help for people who want a starting point.

00:06:23.305 --> 00:06:26.230
Offer a short comparison and let the owner judge whether that

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:28.350
extra help is useful.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:33.585
For price concerns, ask: Is the main concern the budget, or

00:06:33.585 --> 00:06:36.150
whether your customers would use it?

00:06:36.150 --> 00:06:39.250
If the value is unclear, show the relevant part of the

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:40.895
demo again.

00:06:40.895 --> 00:06:44.700
If commitment is the issue, explain the monthly paid option without

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:48.070
promising results or unapproved discounts.

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:52.025
For no time, say: I can prepare your business details and

00:06:52.025 --> 00:06:54.075
send an invitation.

00:06:54.075 --> 00:06:59.265
You still review them, create your own password, and pay yourself.

00:06:59.265 --> 00:07:02.760
Setup help does not mean taking over their account.

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:07.695
If asked for guaranteed five stars, say: No.

00:07:07.695 --> 00:07:10.985
Customers decide their own rating and words.

00:07:10.985 --> 00:07:14.365
We make it easier to describe a real experience; we do

00:07:14.365 --> 00:07:17.705
not control the review or Google's decisions.

00:07:17.705 --> 00:07:21.325
If asked for a free trial, explain that the partner prepared

00:07:21.325 --> 00:07:23.265
route is paid only.

00:07:23.265 --> 00:07:26.095
If they want to discuss it with a colleague, offer the

00:07:26.095 --> 00:07:29.290
information and agree on a follow up time.

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:32.645
A respectful pause is better than pushing someone into a purchase

00:07:32.645 --> 00:07:34.675
they do not understand.

00:07:35.575 --> 00:07:40.115
For a restaurant, say: After a visit, a customer can scan

00:07:40.115 --> 00:07:44.820
and describe the food, service, or atmosphere in their own words.

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:49.330
For a salon, say: A customer can mention the service, staff,

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:53.205
or cleanliness if those topics match their experience.

00:07:53.205 --> 00:07:56.450
Use the owner's language and real services.

00:07:56.450 --> 00:08:01.050
Topics are prompts, not instructions to praise the business.

00:08:01.050 --> 00:08:05.030
Train staff to invite customers neutrally rather than choosing only people

00:08:05.030 --> 00:08:06.675
who seem happy.

00:08:07.225 --> 00:08:11.645
For a clinic or professional service, say: Customers can share what

00:08:11.645 --> 00:08:14.280
they are comfortable making public.

00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:19.150
They should not include private health, financial, or other sensitive details

00:08:19.150 --> 00:08:20.680
in a review.

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:24.020
Do not ask a patient to describe a diagnosis or treatment

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:26.890
outcome just to demonstrate the tool.

00:08:26.890 --> 00:08:30.575
Keep the focus on the voluntary review experience.

00:08:30.575 --> 00:08:34.095
Never imply that using Reviyo improves medical outcomes or that a

00:08:34.095 --> 00:08:37.385
professional endorses a claim they have not made.

00:08:38.285 --> 00:08:42.700
Before closing, check that the owner understands the customer flow, the

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:46.385
limits of the service, the plan amount, and the absence of

00:08:46.385 --> 00:08:48.565
a free trial in this route.

00:08:48.565 --> 00:08:52.155
Ask: Does this solve the issue you mentioned?

00:08:52.155 --> 00:08:54.405
Which paid term suits you?

00:08:54.405 --> 00:08:56.850
Would you like me to prepare the details and send the

00:08:56.850 --> 00:08:59.365
invitation to your own email?

00:08:59.365 --> 00:09:02.515
Do not create an account or send an invitation on someone's

00:09:02.515 --> 00:09:04.765
behalf without their agreement.

00:09:05.315 --> 00:09:08.470
If they are not ready, say: Would you like a short

00:09:08.470 --> 00:09:11.225
summary, and is there a time you would prefer me to

00:09:11.225 --> 00:09:12.745
check back?

00:09:12.745 --> 00:09:16.740
If it is not useful for your business, that is fine.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:20.585
Record only the contact information they agree to share.

00:09:20.585 --> 00:09:24.555
Do not invent a deadline, claim places are running out, or

00:09:24.555 --> 00:09:26.640
repeatedly chase them.

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:30.450
For a ready owner, read their email back carefully.

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:33.625
That email is where the invitation and their account access will

00:09:33.625 --> 00:09:34.640
go.

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:38.875
In your partner dashboard, find Set up a business for an

00:09:38.875 --> 00:09:40.065
owner.

00:09:40.065 --> 00:09:43.905
Enter the owner's own email, the correct business name, and the

00:09:43.905 --> 00:09:45.445
category.

00:09:45.445 --> 00:09:49.815
Prepare the Google review link, an optional logo, and relevant review

00:09:49.815 --> 00:09:51.280
topics.

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:55.115
Suggested topics are a starting point; edit them for the actual

00:09:55.115 --> 00:09:56.545
business.

00:09:56.545 --> 00:09:59.100
Test the Google link and check that it opens the correct

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:00.450
listing.

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:03.785
A saved setup without the link still needs the correct destination

00:10:03.785 --> 00:10:06.935
before customers are asked to post on Google.

00:10:07.485 --> 00:10:09.965
Read the setup summary together.

00:10:09.965 --> 00:10:13.730
Use Save without sending if details still need checking.

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:17.110
When the owner agrees and the details are ready, choose Save

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:18.855
and invite owner.

00:10:18.855 --> 00:10:23.245
Saving the prepared setup registers your referral automatically; do not add

00:10:23.245 --> 00:10:25.580
a duplicate referral for it.

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:29.445
If sending the email fails after saving, use the saved setup

00:10:29.445 --> 00:10:31.055
to resend.

00:10:31.055 --> 00:10:33.745
Do not create repeated drafts.

00:10:33.745 --> 00:10:36.240
A pending setup can be edited.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:40.755
Once the owner takes over, they manage their own business details.

00:10:41.655 --> 00:10:46.075
Tell the owner: Open your Reviyo invitation on your device.

00:10:46.075 --> 00:10:49.565
Create and confirm your own password when asked.

00:10:49.565 --> 00:10:53.130
Keep it private; I do not need to see it.

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:57.825
New invited owners without a password must set one before continuing.

00:10:57.825 --> 00:11:00.905
Owners who already have a password keep it.

00:11:00.905 --> 00:11:05.150
Check the inbox and spam folder if the invitation is missing.

00:11:05.150 --> 00:11:08.795
If a link has expired, resend through the pending setup after

00:11:08.795 --> 00:11:11.260
any displayed waiting period.

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:14.580
Never forward an access link to someone else.

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:18.550
The owner then reviews the prepared business details and can correct

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:19.670
them.

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:24.565
Check the business name, review topics, and Google destination together.

00:11:24.565 --> 00:11:28.110
They read the terms and make their own consent choices.

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:30.845
Do not tick a consent box for them.

00:11:30.845 --> 00:11:33.360
They choose a paid plan next.

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:36.930
You can explain the screen, but never ask for a password,

00:11:36.930 --> 00:11:41.115
email code, bank code, or other private credentials.

00:11:41.115 --> 00:11:44.790
If a problem blocks the flow, pause and contact support rather

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:46.650
than bypassing it.

00:11:47.550 --> 00:11:50.945
At the payment screen, ask the owner to confirm the selected

00:11:50.945 --> 00:11:55.145
plan, the full amount, and any terms shown.

00:11:55.145 --> 00:11:58.580
They open the Razorpay checkout and choose an available payment method

00:11:58.580 --> 00:12:01.995
such as UPI, card, or netbanking.

00:12:01.995 --> 00:12:05.370
Let them complete any verification privately.

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:08.955
Reviyo subscription payments go through its checkout.

00:12:08.955 --> 00:12:12.215
Do not collect them into your personal bank account or UPI

00:12:12.215 --> 00:12:15.180
address, and do not ask the owner to send you a

00:12:15.180 --> 00:12:19.460
screenshot containing card details or an authentication code.

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:23.365
Say: Please finish the payment on your device and return to

00:12:23.365 --> 00:12:24.685
Reviyo.

00:12:24.685 --> 00:12:28.670
We will wait for confirmation before downloading your QR.

00:12:28.670 --> 00:12:31.525
A payment attempt or a bank debit screen alone is not

00:12:31.525 --> 00:12:34.435
confirmation that the setup is active.

00:12:34.435 --> 00:12:37.350
Wait for the confirmed result in Reviyo.

00:12:37.350 --> 00:12:41.145
Once payment is confirmed, the owner can download their QR and

00:12:41.145 --> 00:12:42.995
use the dashboard.

00:12:42.995 --> 00:12:47.520
If confirmation takes longer than expected, follow the next recovery steps

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:50.120
instead of starting another payment.

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:53.905
If the owner has paid but the site is still waiting,

00:12:53.905 --> 00:12:56.275
use Check payment status.

00:12:56.275 --> 00:13:00.355
Keep the payment reference, amount, and approximate time.

00:13:00.355 --> 00:13:02.845
Do not ask them to pay again while that charge is

00:13:02.845 --> 00:13:04.375
uncertain.

00:13:04.375 --> 00:13:08.425
For a cancelled or clearly failed attempt without a successful payment,

00:13:08.425 --> 00:13:11.105
the owner can retry the checkout.

00:13:11.105 --> 00:13:15.320
If money appears debited or the status is unclear, contact support

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:18.260
at reviyo dot in with the reference and explain the screen

00:13:18.260 --> 00:13:19.575
shown.

00:13:19.575 --> 00:13:23.520
Do not share authentication codes or full bank details.

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:28.770
For an invitation problem, confirm the exact owner email, check spam,

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:32.170
and resend the existing pending setup if needed.

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:36.275
For incorrect business details, correct the saved draft before the owner

00:13:36.275 --> 00:13:40.995
takes over, or help the owner find their own settings afterwards.

00:13:40.995 --> 00:13:44.080
Say: Let's check the saved setup and the message on your

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:45.430
screen.

00:13:45.430 --> 00:13:49.610
We will resolve that step before making another account or payment.

00:13:49.610 --> 00:13:53.580
Never promise that a pending transfer is definitely refunded or definitely

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:56.520
successful without a confirmed status.

00:13:57.420 --> 00:14:01.415
After payment is confirmed, help the owner download the QR code

00:14:01.415 --> 00:14:03.775
or printable counter card.

00:14:03.775 --> 00:14:07.015
Scan the actual downloaded code and check the business page and

00:14:07.015 --> 00:14:09.020
Google destination.

00:14:09.020 --> 00:14:12.935
Put it where customers can scan comfortably, such as a counter

00:14:12.935 --> 00:14:15.940
or bill folder with the owner's permission.

00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:19.745
Show the owner how to sign in again, find their dashboard,

00:14:19.745 --> 00:14:21.875
and contact support.

00:14:21.875 --> 00:14:25.555
A sale is not complete just because payment succeeded; the owner

00:14:25.555 --> 00:14:28.060
should be able to use what they bought.

00:14:28.610 --> 00:14:31.780
Teach staff this request: If you would like to share your

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:35.025
experience, you can scan this code.

00:14:35.025 --> 00:14:37.520
You can edit the draft and decide whether to post it

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:38.955
on Google.

00:14:38.955 --> 00:14:43.835
Make that invitation available without judging whether a customer seems happy.

00:14:43.835 --> 00:14:48.070
No gifts, discounts, or demands for five stars.

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:50.905
Ask permission to check back after the owner has used the

00:14:50.905 --> 00:14:51.330
QR.

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:55.465
Review where the customer journey stops, rather than promising a specific

00:14:55.465 --> 00:14:57.300
number of reviews.

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:00.610
Here is a fictional role play.

00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:04.680
Partner: Is now a good time for a two minute demo?

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:07.090
Owner: What does it do?

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:11.655
Partner: First, how do you ask for reviews today?

00:15:11.655 --> 00:15:14.970
Owner: We give people a link, but some do not know

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:16.500
what to write.

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:20.285
Partner: That is the part Reviyo can help with.

00:15:20.285 --> 00:15:23.850
Customers describe their visit and edit a draft before choosing whether

00:15:23.850 --> 00:15:25.770
to post on Google.

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:27.500
May I show you?

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:30.430
Owner: Yes, show me.

00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:33.890
Pause and practise that opening in your own words.

00:15:34.440 --> 00:15:36.555
Continue the role play.

00:15:36.555 --> 00:15:39.755
Partner: Which paid term suits you?

00:15:39.755 --> 00:15:42.805
Owner: Let's start with one month.

00:15:42.805 --> 00:15:47.535
Partner: The current monthly price is five hundred rupees.

00:15:47.535 --> 00:15:50.555
This partner setup has no free trial.

00:15:50.555 --> 00:15:54.380
Shall I prepare your details and email the invitation?

00:15:54.380 --> 00:15:56.410
Owner: Yes.

00:15:56.410 --> 00:15:59.970
Partner: Please check your email address.

00:15:59.970 --> 00:16:04.005
You will open the invitation, set your own password, review the

00:16:04.005 --> 00:16:08.570
details, accept the terms, and pay through Razorpay.

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:11.810
Once confirmed, we will download and test your QR.

00:16:11.810 --> 00:16:14.725
Owner: What if payment is delayed?

00:16:14.725 --> 00:16:19.140
Partner: We check its status before attempting another charge.

00:16:19.690 --> 00:16:24.030
Before your first owner meeting, rehearse the short pitch, one objection,

00:16:24.030 --> 00:16:26.365
and the payment explanation.

00:16:26.365 --> 00:16:29.975
Know where the setup form and support contact are.

00:16:29.975 --> 00:16:33.730
Choose plans for the owner's needs rather than your commission.

00:16:33.730 --> 00:16:37.350
Your private dashboard explains earnings separately.

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:40.890
Only a qualifying first annual payment can earn commission after the

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:45.645
fourteen day checks; monthly and six month payments earn none.

00:16:45.645 --> 00:16:49.880
Keep bank details accurate, and remember that payout timing depends on

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:51.965
checks and processing.

00:16:51.965 --> 00:16:54.655
You are ready when you can explain each step calmly and

00:16:54.655 --> 00:16:56.840
leave the owner in control.
